    LLM: 'Game: Five Card Stud High-Low. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Five Card Stud with pot split between best high hand and best qualifying low hand.',
    objective: 'Win the high half of the pot with the best high hand and/or the low half with the best qualifying low hand (e.g. 8-or-better). Low must qualify to win.',
    gameplay: 'Deal and betting are the same as in ordinary Five Card Stud. At the showdown the pot is split equally between the highest and lowest hands; the odd chip goes to the high hand if the pot cannot be divided exactly by two. In home games players declare high or low (usually not both) after the final betting round; the best high among declarers and the best low among declarers share the pot.',
